   "titulo": "Experiences",
   "texto": [
    "To say if anything had happened before, use **før** (before), **aldrig** (never) or **endnu** (still).",
    "Question: **Havde du været i Danmark før?** = Have you been to Denmark before?",
    "Answer: **Nej, jeg havde aldrig været der.** = No, I had never been there."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Reasons",
   "texto": [
    "What had happened before can explain what happened next: **Jeg var træt, fordi jeg havde arbejdet hele dagen.** = I was tired because I had worked all day.",
    "With **fordi**, the auxiliary goes in front of the participle: **fordi jeg havde arbejdet**."
   ]
